#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&krita; is part of the &koffice; package. &krita; is a photo retouching, "
"image editing application, but above all, a paint application that will "
"allow you to create original art on your computer as if you were working "
"with paint and brushes, pencils, pen and ink &mdash; or, at least, it will "
"one day. We are continually working on extending &krita; and making it "
"better in every respect."
msgstr ""

